  strSuccess: Successful Completion
  strRanOutOfSan: Employee Death
  strDeadOfFish: Fish Death
  strSubSuccess: "Over the course of your seven-day probation, you\u2019ve handled
    X anomalies. You\u2019re officially a qualified aquarium caretaker now. It seems
    they\u2019ve grown quite fond of you. Here\u2019s to many more days together!"
  strSubRanOutOfSan: "What a shame. It seems they weren\u2019t particularly fond
    of you. Still, becoming a source of nutrients for them is just another wonderful
    part of life\u2019s great cycle\u2026"
  strSubDeadOfFish: "All fish must die someday, but not during your probation period.
    How unfortunate. Your employment evaluation will be laid to rest alongside the
    fish\u2019s remains, sinking into the depths of the ocean to become nutrients
    for the seabed."
